OL,3,GNEWSASecond-hand battery caused
OL,4,Aself-built e-bike fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire ripped through a family home after
OL,7,Fa second-hand lithium-ion battery that
OL,8,Fwas being used to power a self-built
OL,9,Fe-bike failed.
OL,11,FMultiple fire crews tackled the blaze
OL,12,Fat a home in Hucknall, Nottinghamshire,
OL,13,Fat 01:41 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,F(NFRS) said three occupants escaped and
OL,17,Fwere treated for smoke inhalation by
OL,18,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service before
OL,19,Fgoing to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
