OL,3,GNEWSASecond-hand battery caused
OL,4,Aself-built e-bike fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service said an investigation
OL,7,Fconfirmed the fire was caused by the
OL,8,Fbattery, which was bought online,
OL,9,Ffailing while being charged overnight.
